      "id": "p1",
      "companyId": "xai",
      "name": "Grok",
      "handle": "@grok",
      "time": "3d",
      "text": "Grok is now part of The X Subscription. Get Grok, Cursor, and X Premium benefits in one plan starting at $8/month, with five tiers to choose from. Subscribe today, or if you're already on SuperGrok, head to your account settings to switch to The X Subscription.",
      "replies": "354",
      "reposts": "277",
      "likes": "3K",
      "inlineHandle": false,
      "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2109783860636500318"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "companyId": "openai",
      "name": "OpenAI",
      "handle": "@OpenAI",
      "time": "23h",
      "text": "New voices. Better accents. And less \"checking...\" GPT-Live-1.1 brings these updates to Voice in ChatGPT, Codex, and dots, with new voices in French, German, Hindi, Mexican Spanish, Korean, and Japanese. Rolling out today to all users. Coming soon to the API. https://t.co/L6K8ZUC1xm",
      "replies": "786",
      "reposts": "752",
      "likes": "10.6K",
      "inlineHandle": false,
      "url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2110797830361436604"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "companyId": "meta",
      "name": "AI at Meta",
      "handle": "@AIatMeta",
      "time": "1d",
      "text": "Today we’re releasing Muse Spark Open, the most capable US open-weight model to date. Built for coding and agentic work, it excels at long-horizon tasks, complex software engineering, and multi-step reasoning. Key Model Specs: → 816B total / 42B active parameters → 1M token context window → Natively multimodal across text, image, video, audio",
      "replies": "432",
      "reposts": "1.1K",
      "likes": "10.9K",
      "inlineHandle": false,
      "url": "https://x.com/AIatMeta/status/2110779754274292212"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "companyId": "anthropic",
      "name": "Anthropic",
      "handle": "@AnthropicAI",
      "time": "3d",
      "text": "New on our Engineering blog: Creating in-house source control. In May, we merged around 2,500 code changes per day. In September, we merged more than 30,000 per day. As a result, we became bottlenecked by developer infrastructure built for human (rather than agent) scale. Here, we share how we built a new version control system—and fully migrated our monorepo from git—in five months: https://t.co/wzNkwHs7IN",
      "replies": "1.1K",
      "reposts": "2.6K",
      "likes": "25.6K",
      "inlineHandle": false,
      "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2110047081414987957"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "companyId": "deepmind",
      "name": "Google Gemini",
      "handle": "@GeminiApp",
      "time": "3d",
      "text": "The moment you've been waiting 4… Our new frontier model, Gemini 4 Argon, is rolling out now in the Gemini app to bring your most complex ideas into reality. See how Gemini 4 Argon and our latest updates across the Gemini app help you get the most out of every prompt. 🧵",
      "replies": "460",
      "reposts": "737",
